WEBVTT

00:00:58.636 --> 00:01:02.116
But then in 2015,
we elected a new government.

00:01:03.116 --> 00:01:05.956
And Prime Minister Trudeau came to Paris

00:01:05.996 --> 00:01:08.396
and with his hand on his heart,

00:01:08.436 --> 00:01:11.236
he said, "Canada's back."

00:01:11.236 --> 00:01:15.316
And he went home to introduce
some really good climate policy,

00:01:15.356 --> 00:01:16.676
carbon pricing.

00:01:17.556 --> 00:01:20.116
And our emissions didn't go down.

00:01:20.916 --> 00:01:24.196
And the government
continued to green-light

00:01:24.196 --> 00:01:26.636
and even subsidize

00:01:26.636 --> 00:01:30.236
new oil sands, pipelines and fracking.